# INVWINHA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Options >
# Settings at level 1.  The dialog shows the settings file, INV.CFG,
# which holds only the WINPANE.ITEM=0 of TEST/WIN/INV.CFG yet: every
# default, the data directory DATA\.  The station, the item list's order
# LOC, the baud rate 19200 and RTS/CTS are set and saved, which a
# message box says, the start-only settings named, the data directory
# left unset in the file, whose first line stays
# (TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INV.CFG); the item list opens again by location at
# once.  Settings again shows what was saved; Alt and a label's letter
# moves the focus to the baud rate's list and to the RTS/CTS check box;
# the settings file, which cannot be changed, has no letter, so F alone
# from there leaves the focus on the check box; Cancel leaves it.  After
# a log-out the login opens the item list by location still.  The end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINHA.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-O S
S SETTINGS
K TAB
T LAB
K TAB TAB DOWN TAB DOWN TAB SPACE
S TYPED
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
S BYLOC
K ALT-O S
S SHOWN
K ALT-B
S ALTB
K ALT-R
S ALTR
K F
S ALONE
K ESC
S LEFT
K ALT-F L
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ALT-F X
